		{"id":"58c9df9c4bb0bf02","x":-80,"y":-230,"width":250,"height":210,"type":"text","text":"Unlockable party members\nA special npc per faction can be recruited into the players party. The npc can be unlocked as a party member when the player participates in some event."},
		{"id":"c6f5e90236f6e774","type":"text","text":"Party members follow RPG logic. A player's party can be changed at any time. A party can at most have 3 members to fight alongside the player at any time. if a team member is killed, a new one can be summoned and the current party member is wounded and cannot be sent out again. Until healed","x":-80,"y":0,"width":250,"height":310}
